{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2014-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1419379200, "end_date": 1420070399, "month_true_total": 1174, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:52:22 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "13748548", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079114168", "personaname": "Nokk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Eye_for_an_eye/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 99562, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 95, "last_played": 1656590654, "avatar": "b1d4cc84856c3bc9e7851ec960dff8dfc35426ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game used to be GREAT!  and after several mods and uselss updates, and more mods, the entire fun factor is gone.  Allot of what was changed, was never broken.  The game is now just boring, and without FUN.  Please ignore the hours showing on this game for Steam, in beta I did not use Steam for this game, and I have WELL OVER 500+ hours into this game.", "timestamp_created": 1420069460, "timestamp_updated": 1427713604, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "13746977", "author": {"steamid": "76561198108171704", "personaname": "chris.s.clevenger", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198108171704/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 91381, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12267, "last_played": 1766815977, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe is a very good game, great looks and feel to the game. Easy to get the hang of it. \nNow before anyone starts \"Yelling\" at me saying it's a pay to win game, I'll say this... oh sure you can pay to get almost everything in the game with real cash. But with that said all it does is give it to you and make room for it for you, you still need to go level it and learn to use it. \nSo not pay to win, but pay to make it quicker, yes for sure. \n\nMy only small con to the game is they added in tons of stuff that in my book should have been given to the players for free, but they charge for it as well; like \"Colors\" to change you warframes looks to a better color. You'll need to pay for that... or like me... never do it, so no worries. \n\nThe game is a Grind! You need to find frineds and run though mission over and over to get Mods to become more powerful....\n\nRecommend this game? Oh sure, its very fun and if you don't want to spend anything it is free. Who can beat free?", "timestamp_created": 1420063240, "timestamp_updated": 1420063240, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502400755882263184", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "13746064", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075827383", "personaname": "Nemiri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/founderoframranch/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 136476, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 50882, "last_played": 1787974851, "avatar": "9c0782bf8f4544a2f63d5471204c8c90143c4e05"}, "language": "english", "review": "its not that bad", "timestamp_created": 1420060250, "timestamp_updated": 1420060250, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "13745771", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046699640", "personaname": "Atlas Fontaine", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Atlas_Fontaine/", "num_games_owned": 327, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 61685, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 22636, "last_played": 1735057897, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Do you like a light stealth element and awesome grouping capabilities? Do you enjoy assassinating your target and vanishing without a trace? Do you revel in using awesome built in stealth routes and abilities? Then watch as this game gives you ALL of those things and your teammates throw it away to instead die multiple times and warn the entire galaxy you're going to kill a boss! 10/10 would play again", "timestamp_created": 1420059233, "timestamp_updated": 1420059233, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "13745566", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125356799", "personaname": "WWW.TWITCH.TV/ScreaM", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Aburamadansmurfing1/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 120, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 86, "last_played": 1420143770, "avatar": "187a6c5a9afdc9d4220d049db0d4ff2166449cf2"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1420058622, "timestamp_updated": 1420058622, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_durin